      "description": "## 🔄 Search Banking Activities Flow\n\n| **Step** | Request Name | **Description** |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Generate Access Token | Obtain an access token using client credentials to authorize API requests. |\n| 2a | \\[Option 1\\] Search Banking Activities - Basic Criteria | Retrieve banking activities based on a specified date range. |\n| 2b | \\[Option 2\\] Search Banking Activities - Next Page Token | Continue retrieving banking activities by using the nextPageToken returned from a previous search response to support pagination. |\n| 2c | \\[Option 3\\] Search Banking Activities - Event ID | Retrieve specific banking activities by supplying unique event ID(s) for precise event-level lookup. |\n| 2d | \\[Option 4\\] Search Banking Activities - Event Type | Retrieve specific banking activities by filtering on event type. |\n| 2e | \\[Option 5\\] Search Banking Activities - Retail User | Retrieve banking activities linked to a specific retail user using the user ID. |\n| 2f | \\[Option 6\\] Search Banking Activities - Company ID | Retrieve banking activities linked to a specific business using the company ID, commonly used in business banking scenarios. |\n| 2g | \\[Option 7\\] Search Banking Activities - Business User | Retrieve banking activities linked to a specific business user using the user ID. |\n| 2h | \\[Option 8\\] Search Banking Activities - Filters | Retrieve banking activities using advanced filtering criteria. |\n| 2i | \\[Option 9\\] Search Banking Activities - Filters and SubFilters | Perform a refined search for banking activities using filters and sub-filters to support complex query conditions and precise results. |\n| 2j | \\[Option 10\\] Search Banking Activities - Requested Attributes | Retrieve banking activities while restricting the response to specified attributes to reduce payload size and improve performance. |",
